#702 PRE-READ - the frozen primary (tl / orh5 / the low-of-day stop / c3_p33_t20_cut3 / spec key, first break per base) read on D 2017-03-01 .. 2021-12-31, the years he 10x'd, and on 2020-21 alone. Registered before any outcome: docs/analysis/cb_2017_21_read_prereg_2026-10-19.md. Measurement only: nothing here chooses a level, an entry, a stop or an exit.
source: trades_pre_p5.tsv.gz; rows read 8. POPULATION: the era's spec-key first breaks filled at orh5 under the registered stop on tl/com; a group is the MATURE walks only (n_open counted, never in a number); month-block bootstrap (2,000 draws, seed 702) 95% interval on the mean R; ADR = mean P&L in ADR20 x price units; years are the calendar year of the breakout day E.
BARS (§5 of cb_preregistration_2026-10-18.md, word for word): PASS = n >= 30 mature AND interval lower end > 0 AND mean R without the top 5 > 0 AND ADR P&L > 0 AND beats C0 on mean R and on the >= 5R share; FAIL = n >= 30 AND (interval upper end < 0 OR does not beat C0 on mean R); else CAN'T TELL (n decides first). C1 decides; C0 is the baseline and cannot pass; com, the other arms, the chain key and the report cells are never a verdict.
NOT ANSWERED: Alpaca's symbol list omits many delisted names (survivorship), so a PASS is weaker than it looks and a FAIL is not explained by it; his discretion (what he chose, his sizing, adds) is not modelled; an edge that lives in one exceptional bull market is a regime bet.
